 of this book as they teach their kiddos about values:&nbsp; Positivity, Loyalty, Sense of Humor, Tenacity, and Unconditional Love.</h4>\r\n<h4 style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-family: -apple-system, 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Ubuntu, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol'; font-weight: var(--font-heading-weight); color: rgb(var(--color-foreground)); line-height: calc(1 + .3/max(1,var(--font-heading-scale))); word-break: break-word; font-size: calc(var(--font-heading-scale) * 1.5rem); text-align: left; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(253, 253, 252);\">Check out our shop for more golden treasures where you'll find mugs, bags, journals, and even ornaments celebrating these core values!</h4>\r\n<h4 style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-family: -apple-system, 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Ubuntu, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol'; font-weight: var(--font-heading-weight); color: rgb(var(--color-foreground)); line-height: calc(1 + .3/max(1,var(--font-heading-scale))); word-break: break-word; font-size: calc(var(--font-heading-scale) * 1.5rem); text-align: left; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(253, 253, 252);\">A portion of all profits are donated to underprivileged youth.</h4>",
